<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπάλᾰθος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰ], ὁ,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			749
		</span></i>, but more commonly ἡ, as <i><span class="en">
			Pherecr.
			109
		</span></i> (s. v.l.), <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>Od.</u>
			33
		</span></i>:—name of a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spinous shrub,</i> yielding a fragrant oil, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυσίσκηπτρον</span>
			, <i>camel's thorn, Alhagi maurorum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				9.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Od.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>thorny trefoil, Calycotome villosa,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1193
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				906b11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				4.57
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				24.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>Genista acanthoclada,</i> used as an instrument of torture, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀσπαλάθων τινὰ κνάμπτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					616a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
